      en: "The Chefette Production Centre is the manufacturing hub for the popular Barbadian fast-food chain Chefette, located in St. Michael, Barbados. Expanded in 2008, it supplies over 20 restaurants across the island with prepared foods including chicken, fries, and sandwiches. The facility employs about 150 people and uses advanced food processing technologies. Chefette is a major employer in the food industry and a symbol of local brand strength. The centre covers 4,000 square meters and processes several tons of food daily. Chefette products are also exported to neighboring islands.",
